  "description": "Audit-trail integrity abstractions for the Excalibur framework. Defines the shared, backend-agnostic tamper-evidence contract (keyed-MAC + hash-chain) consumed by every audit sink, plus the deterministic record canonicalization helper and the signing-key provider abstraction. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
